{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve the emitted timestamp's microseconds**\n\nThe conversion floors timestamps to whole milliseconds even though plugin `emittedAt` values contain microseconds. Rapid `on-change` records can consequently receive identical OTLP timestamps and lose ordering. Preserve Python's microsecond precision and test a timestamp with a fractional-millisecond component.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7uC9CA","finding_digest":"599032b202d900fe562c3949b4842231740003c0dbcef7c3c3ce81d90ba4d3ec","finding_id":"arf_v1_lgidfmqc3eap4vrmhfe3jbbcgf","finding_key":"insight/exporters/otel_exporter.py::_to_nano::submillisecond-precision","identity_key":"insight/exporters/otel_exporter.py::_to_nano::submillisecond-precision","line":47,"observation_digest":"36ddaf22e99468fafa76cc5ac1483a2e36a8079a1620f2dd6f8cd1b56770df46","observation_id":"aro_v1_g3o26ixjsrupv6twzrnmcsb2fy","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/exporters/otel_exporter.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-11T22:03:51Z","review_id":"arr_v1_au5e3inkypj77dyafq5zyn566k","reviewed_base_sha":"8742ad9c9535e1de042963963c6b439f656894ce","reviewed_head_sha":"7f24921722e226045a5f548585ea7fbad6134fcf","reviewer":"codex","start_line":45,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_v3l4wqihpbw53ze46knfti4gwg"},"pull_request":{"number":720},"record_id":"art_v1_2zssjeqccfucbolwudrjimhejw","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-11T22:03:51Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
